MyBrowser
=========

A portable browser launcher for Windows, maintained by Dr Sohil Momin
(https://github.com/drsamonline/MyChrome). This repository is the project's home:
source, build, tests, releases and landing page all live here, and nothing is fetched
from another repository at build time.

